-- חוזר לבעלויות תשפ"ג/1 (24.7.2022): פתיחת תיקי גננות ודיווח משרות; העסקת
-- עובדי הוראה, עובדי בעלות, בגני הילדים לחינוך מיוחד המוכרים שאינם רשמיים,
-- בהתאם לרפורמת אופק חדש בשנה"ל תשפ"ג.
-- Part א, for every owner of a recognized-unofficial special-education
-- kindergarten: the reporting officer, the online files, employment
-- approval and position reports that the profile is computed from. Part ב,
-- for owners joining Ofek Hadash in 2022-23: the steps, who joins, the
-- kindergarten work week, part time and over-full positions, mothers and
-- age hours, activity hours, promotion, role allowances, the grade
-- conversion and the advances until the grade is set; and the annexes.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

-- Time in this file is counted in DAYS from the circular's date, 24 July
-- 2022 (day 0), where a rule has a date.
`24 July 2022`     MEANS 0
`15 August 2022`   MEANS 22
`31 December 2022` MEANS 160

§ `חוזר לבעלויות תשפ"ג/1`

-- akn:preamble The letterhead, date, reference number, circular number, addressee (owners of recognized-unofficial special-education kindergartens), greeting and the two subjects; no rule.
-- akn:art_a/p1 akn:art_b/p1 The two topics the circular covers, and to whom each is addressed (part א to every owner, joined or not; part ב to owners asking to join in 2022-23); the parts' rules follow.

DECLARE `circular 1 action` IS ONE OF
    `appoint a single reporting officer`
    `submit the reporting-officer permission form by email`
    `request a change of reporting officer in writing`
    `pass the reporting permission to another person`
    `direct employees to open an online file`
    `approve the file and certify documents true to the original`
    `report the placement institution code`
    `direct existing employees to check their data on the portal`
    `obtain an employment approval for every teaching employee`
    `report the positions of all teaching employees`
    `submit the owner's undertaking through the portal`
    `transfer the salary interface to the Ministry's contractor`
    `adjust the kindergarten day to Ofek Hadash end times`
    `set the timetable by the Ofek Hadash work week`
    `pay by the grade set, deducting the advances`
    `submit a request to the exceptions committee`
    `submit the academic-completion undertaking`
    `submit a request not to join`
    `monitor the undertakings to complete an academic degree`
    `pay the Ofek Hadash advance` HAS `advance paid` IS A NUMBER
    `label the advance on the payslip`
    `send each employee annex A's letter`
    `have each employee sign annex B's undertaking`
    `keep the employees' undertakings and pass them on request`
    `pass the Ministry the data and payslips it requires`

§ `א. דיווח לצורך חישוב פרופיל גני ילדים`

-- akn:art_b__para_a/p1 The heading of part א (reporting the teaching staff of recognized-unofficial special-education kindergartens).

-- Part א ¶2: from 2020-21 every teaching employee in such a kindergarten
-- opens an online file with the Ministry and the owner reports the
-- employment every year. ¶3-¶5: why (an information base like the schools';
-- the Ministry sets education, certification and seniority and the rights
-- that follow, approves employment, checks criminal records, and budgets the
-- kindergartens by their staff — the profile). ¶6: the owner's steps follow.
@ref akn:art_b__para_a/p2
GIVEN `school year starting` IS A NUMBER @desc the calendar year the school year starts in (2020 = 2020-21)
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `every employee has an online file and is reported yearly in` `school year starting` IF
    `school year starting` AT LEAST 2020

-- akn:art_b__para_a/p3 akn:art_b__para_a/p4 akn:art_b__para_a/p5 akn:art_b__para_a/p6 The purpose of the reporting (an information base; the Ministry's determinations and budgeting by the staff's profile) and the request to act on what follows; the duties are the steps below.

-- Step 1: ONE reporting officer, an employee of the owner (in an
-- employer-employee relation, not a service provider), preferably from HR,
-- given the role "אחראי דיווח גני ילדים חינוך מיוחד מוכר שאינו רשמי"; an
-- owner without one submits the permission form by email; the senior
-- division approves it; the permission is personal and may not be passed
-- on; a change needs a written request; no more than one officer.
@ref akn:art_b__para_a__subpara_1/p1 akn:art_b__para_a__subpara_1/p2 akn:art_b__para_a__subpara_1/p3 akn:art_b__para_a__subpara_1/p4 akn:art_b__para_a__subpara_1/p5 akn:art_b__para_a__subpara_1/p6 akn:art_b__para_a__subpara_1/p7
GIVEN `officers` IS A NUMBER, `an employee of the owner` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the reporting officer may be approved` `officers` `an employee of the owner` IF
    `officers` EQUALS 1 AND `an employee of the owner`

GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `circular 1 action`
DECIDE `the reporting officer's permission is personal` IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    SHANT `pass the reporting permission to another person`
    LEST BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "circular תשפ\"ג/1 part א step 1: the permission is personal and may not be passed on"

-- Step 2 (א)-(ב): each year the owner directs its teaching employees
-- (kindergarten teachers and health professionals), new ones and those
-- without a file, to open an online file on the portal, filling the
-- questionnaire. (ג): the officer approves the file, certifies the
-- documents "true to the original" and reports the placement institution's
-- code (a cluster's code, not the kindergarten's, for one in a cluster).
@ref akn:art_b__para_a__subpara_2/p1 akn:art_b__para_a__subpara_2__cls_a/p1 akn:art_b__para_a__subpara_2__cls_b/p1 akn:art_c/p1
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `circular 1 action`
DECIDE `the yearly file duties` IS
         (PARTY `the employer` MUST `direct employees to open an online file`)
    RAND (PARTY `the employer` MUST `approve the file and certify documents true to the original`)
    RAND (PARTY `the employer` MUST `report the placement institution code`)

GIVEN `in a kindergarten cluster` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A STRING
DECIDE `the code reported` `in a kindergarten cluster` IS
    IF `in a kindergarten cluster` THEN "the cluster's code" ELSE "the kindergarten's code"

-- (ד): three stages — the employee (questionnaire with education and
-- seniority documents), the owner (certification, file approval, placement
-- report), the personnel division (grade and seniority, approval).
@ref akn:art_d/p1 akn:art_d/p2 akn:art_d/p3 akn:art_d/p4 akn:art_d/p5
GIVEN `stage` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A Party
DECIDE `who is responsible for file stage` `stage` IS
    IF `stage` EQUALS 1 THEN `the teaching employee`
    ELSE IF `stage` EQUALS 2 THEN `the employer`
         ELSE `the Ministry of Education`

-- akn:art_e/p1 Where the employees' guidance and the user guide are published; no rule.

-- (ו): the owner directs existing employees to check on the portal that
-- their education and seniority data are current; other updates go to the
-- district, in one of three ways (in person, by post, or by the officer by
-- email with certified copies); district details are in annex ח.
@ref akn:art_f/p1 akn:art_f/p2 akn:art_f/p3 akn:art_f/p4 akn:art_f/p5
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `circular 1 action`
DECIDE `existing employees check their data` IS
    PARTY `the employer` MUST `direct existing employees to check their data on the portal`

-- akn:art_f/p6 akn:art_f/p7 Where an institution's district and the districts' contacts are found (annex ח) and the attached portal guidance; no rule.

-- Step 3: an employment approval for every teaching employee, per the
-- circular on candidates for 2022-23. Step 4: report the positions of ALL
-- teaching employees, those joining Ofek Hadash and those staying pre-reform,
-- in the placement system — a duty of every owner, joined or not, in 2020-21,
-- 2021-22 or 2022-23. Step 5: then the profile is computed from them.
@ref akn:art_f__para_3/p1 akn:art_f__para_4/p1 akn:art_f__para_4/p2 akn:art_f__para_4/p3 akn:art_f__para_5/p1
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `circular 1 action`
DECIDE `the approval and reporting duties of every owner` IS
         (PARTY `the employer` MUST `obtain an employment approval for every teaching employee`)
    RAND (PARTY `the employer` MUST `report the positions of all teaching employees`)

GIVEN `files opened` IS A BOOLEAN, `positions reported` IS A BOOLEAN, `employment approved` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the profile can be computed` `files opened` `positions reported` `employment approved` IF
    `files opened` AND `positions reported` AND `employment approved`

§ `ב. העסקת עובדי הוראה בגני הילדים לחינוך מיוחד המוכרים שאינם רשמיים, בהתאם לרפורמת אופק חדש בשנה"ל תשפ"ג`

-- akn:art_f__para_5__subpara_b/p1 The heading of part ב (the corpus nests it under part א's step 5).

§§ `1 מבוא`

-- akn:art_f__para_5__subpara_b__cls_1/p1 The heading "מבוא".
-- akn:art_f__para_5__subpara_b__cls_1/p2 akn:art_f__para_5__subpara_b__cls_1/p3 akn:art_f__para_5__subpara_b__cls_1/p4 akn:art_f__para_5__subpara_b__cls_1/p5 akn:art_f__para_5__subpara_b__cls_1/p6 Background: HCJ 6677/19, the inter-ministerial team, its report (linked) and the application of Ofek Hadash to these kindergartens from 2020-21; no rule.
-- akn:art_f__para_5__subpara_b__cls_1/p8 The part's purpose; no rule.

DECLARE `decision` IS ONE OF
    `approving a teaching employee's joining of Ofek Hadash`
    `setting the Ofek Hadash grade and converting the salary`
    `setting the education grade and the teaching seniority`

-- 1 ¶7: the Ministry is the ONLY body that approves joining, sets the
-- grade and converts the salary; it also sets education grade and seniority.
@ref akn:art_f__para_5__subpara_b__cls_1/p7
GIVEN d IS A `decision`
GIVETH A Party
DECIDE `who decides` d IS `the Ministry of Education`

§§ `2 תחומי אחריות ביישום הרפורמה`

-- akn:art_f__para_5__subpara_b__cls_2/p1 The heading of section 2.
-- akn:art_f__para_2-1/p1 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1/p1 The headings "שלב ראשון" and "actions by the owner"; the actions follow.

-- 2.1.1(1): until the recognized-institutions regulations (1953) are
-- amended, an owner joining in 2022-23 undertakes to apply Ofek Hadash
-- (its text and annexes A and B below), through the portal only, by
-- 15.8.2022; annexes A and B stay with the owner for later control.
@ref akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_1/p1 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_1/p2 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_1/p3 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_1/p5 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_1/p6
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `circular 1 action`
DECIDE `the owner's undertaking` IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `submit the owner's undertaking through the portal`
    WITHIN `15 August 2022`
    LEST BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "circular תשפ\"ג/1 2.1.1(1): the undertaking to join Ofek Hadash in 2022-23 is due by 15.8.2022"

-- akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_1/p4 The portal link; no rule.

-- 2.1.1(2)-(4): open files (part א); identify the employees who meet the
-- joining conditions (section 3); report positions of all of them.
-- (The corpus runs items 2-4 into item 1's paragraphs.)
@ref akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_1/p7 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_1/p8 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_1/p9 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_1/p10 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_1/p11
`the joining steps include part א's` MEANS TRUE

-- 2.1.1(5): those who meet the conditions work the Ofek Hadash work week
-- and are paid on its terms — until their grade is set, on the terms of
-- the Ofek Hadash advance ("as set out in section 12 below";
-- F-2022-23_tashpag_01-a: the advances are section 13).
-- 2.1.1(6)-(7): the kindergarten day is adjusted to the Ofek Hadash end
-- times (4.1.4) and the timetable set by its work week.
-- 2.1.1(8)-(9): the owner sends the salary interface to the contractor
-- (Unique); once the grade is set, pays by it from joining and deducts the
-- advances ("section 12 below" again).
@ref akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_5/p1 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_5/p2 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_6/p1 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_7/p1 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_8/p1 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_8/p2 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_8/p3 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-1__cls_9/p1
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `circular 1 action`
DECIDE `the owner's implementation duties` IS
         (PARTY `the employer` MUST `adjust the kindergarten day to Ofek Hadash end times`)
    RAND (PARTY `the employer` MUST `set the timetable by the Ofek Hadash work week`)
    RAND (PARTY `the employer` MUST `transfer the salary interface to the Ministry's contractor`)
    RAND (PARTY `the employer` MUST `pay by the grade set, deducting the advances`)

-- F-2022-23_tashpag_01-a: part ב's sections and what they are about.
DECLARE `part B section` HAS
    `section no`    IS A NUMBER
    `section topic` IS A STRING

`part B's sections` MEANS
    LIST `part B section` 1  "introduction",
         `part B section` 2  "responsibilities",
         `part B section` 3  "joining conditions",
         `part B section` 4  "work week",
         `part B section` 5  "part time",
         `part B section` 6  "above 100%",
         `part B section` 7  "mother",
         `part B section` 8  "age hours",
         `part B section` 9  "activity hours",
         `part B section` 10 "promotion",
         `part B section` 11 "role allowances",
         `part B section` 12 "grade determination",
         `part B section` 13 "salary advances",
         `part B section` 14 "precedence"

GIVEN n IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A LIST OF STRING
DECIDE `the topic of section` n IS
    map (GIVEN s YIELD s's `section topic`) (filter (GIVEN s YIELD s's `section no` EQUALS n) `part B's sections`)

`2.1.1(5) and (9) send the advances to a section about something else` MEANS
    NOT (`the topic of section` 12 EQUALS LIST "salary advances")
    AND `the topic of section` 13 EQUALS LIST "salary advances"
#ASSERT `2.1.1(5) and (9) send the advances to a section about something else`

-- akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-2/p1 The heading "actions by the Ministry".

-- 2.1.2: the Ministry approves owners who signed the undertaking in time,
-- joins their kindergartens in its systems, handles exceptional joining
-- (3.2.1) and requests not to join (3.6), checks each employee's
-- conditions, sets grades, computes the profile and reimburses the owner
-- for those approved and employed on Ofek Hadash terms, less the advances paid.
@ref akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-2__cls_1/p1 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-2__cls_2/p1 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-2__cls_3/p1 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-2__cls_3/p2 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-2__cls_3__pnt_a/p1 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-2__cls_3__pnt_b/p1 akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-2__cls_3__pnt_c/p1
GIVEN `undertaking submitted on` IS A NUMBER @desc the day the owner's undertaking reached the Ministry (days from 24 July 2022)
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the Ministry approves the owner's joining` `undertaking submitted on` IF
    `undertaking submitted on` AT MOST `15 August 2022`

GIVEN `reimbursement before deduction` IS A NUMBER, `advances paid` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the reimbursement` `reimbursement before deduction` `advances paid` IS
    `reimbursement before deduction` MINUS `advances paid`

§§ `3 תנאי ההצטרפות`

-- akn:art_f__para_2-1__subpara_2-1-2__cls_3__pnt_c__pnt_3/p1 The heading of section 3 (the corpus nests it under 2.1.2).
-- akn:art_f__para_3-1/p1 The heading "הגדרות".

@desc A teaching employee, as far as sections 3-13 ask.
DECLARE `kindergarten employee` HAS
    `recognized teaching seniority`       IS A NUMBER  @desc years of actual teaching recognized for pay seniority (internship, army or national service in teaching not counted)
    `academic`                            IS A BOOLEAN @desc 3.1.3: a degree from an Israeli institution, a foreign degree the Ministry recognized, or an approved equivalent salary grade
    `teaching certificate`                IS A BOOLEAN @desc 3.1.4: a teaching certificate or certification another way under the Ministry's rules
    `employee's position fraction`        IS A NUMBER  @desc the share of a full position (1 = 100%)
    `signed the academic-completion undertaking` IS A BOOLEAN
    `approved by the exceptions committee` IS A BOOLEAN

-- 3.1.1-3.1.4: new / existing / academic / certified.
@ref akn:art_f__para_3-1__subpara_3-1-1/p1 akn:art_f__para_3-1__subpara_3-1-2/p1 akn:art_f__para_3-1__subpara_3-1-3/p1 akn:art_f__para_3-1__subpara_3-1-4/p1
GIVEN e IS A `kindergarten employee`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `is an existing employee` e IF
    e's `recognized teaching seniority` GREATER THAN 0

-- akn:art_f__para_3-2/p1 The heading of 3.2.

-- 3.2.1: an existing academic joins if certified and at a third of a
-- position or more; one without certification may ask the exceptions
-- committee through the owner (annex ד, portal), by 31.12.2022.
@ref akn:art_f__para_3-2__subpara_3-2-1/p1 akn:art_f__para_3-2__subpara_3-2-1/p2 akn:art_f__para_3-2__subpara_3-2-1/p3 akn:art_f__para_3-2__subpara_3-2-1/p4 akn:art_f__para_3-2__subpara_3-2-1/p5 akn:art_f__para_3-2__subpara_3-2-1/p8
GIVEN e IS A `kindergarten employee`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an existing academic joins` e IF
        `is an existing employee` e
    AND e's `academic`
    AND (e's `teaching certificate` OR e's `approved by the exceptions committee`)
    AND e's `employee's position fraction` AT LEAST (1 DIVIDED BY 3)

GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `circular 1 action`
DECIDE `exceptions-committee requests by 31.12.2022` IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MAY   `submit a request to the exceptions committee`
    WITHIN `31 December 2022`

-- akn:art_f__para_3-2__subpara_3-2-1/p6 akn:art_f__para_3-2__subpara_3-2-1/p7 The portal link; no rule.

-- 3.2.1 ¶9: without certification and with seniority BELOW 25, no
-- promotion until certified; work and part of the studies are recognized
-- "as set out in section 12.2.2". F-2022-23_tashpag_01-b: there is no
-- 12.2.2 here; promotion of the uncertified is 10.2.2. F-2022-23_tashpag_01-d.
@ref akn:art_f__para_3-2__subpara_3-2-1/p9
GIVEN e IS A `kindergarten employee`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `cannot be promoted until certified under 3.2.1` e IF
    (NOT e's `teaching certificate`) AND e's `recognized teaching seniority` LESS THAN 25

-- The section numbers of part ב that have sub-sections "x.2.2" — 10.2.2
-- (promotion) is the clause 3.2.1 means; section 12's own sub-items run
-- 12.1-12.6 with no 12.2.2.
`part B's numbered sub-sub-sections ending .2.2` MEANS LIST "10.2.2"
`3.2.1 sends the uncertified to 12.2.2, which the circular does not have` MEANS
    NOT elem "12.2.2" `part B's numbered sub-sub-sections ending .2.2`
#ASSERT `3.2.1 sends the uncertified to 12.2.2, which the circular does not have`

-- akn:art_f__para_3-3/p1 The heading of 3.3.

-- 3.3.1-3.3.2: a non-academic with seniority up to 27 (inclusive) signs an
-- undertaking to complete a degree within four years of signing (annex ג,
-- through the portal, by 31.12.2022) and does not join until he signs; 28
-- or more need not sign and is employed on reform terms in any case.
@ref akn:art_f__para_3-3__subpara_3-3-1/p1 akn:art_f__para_3-3__subpara_3-3-1/p4 akn:art_f__para_3-3__subpara_3-3-2/p1
GIVEN e IS A `kindergarten employee`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an existing non-academic joins` e IF
        `is an existing employee` e
    AND NOT e's `academic`
    AND (e's `recognized teaching seniority` AT LEAST 28 OR e's `signed the academic-completion undertaking`)

GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `circular 1 action`
DECIDE `the academic-completion undertakings by 31.12.2022` IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `submit the academic-completion undertaking`
    WITHIN `31 December 2022`
    LEST BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "circular תשפ\"ג/1 3.3.1: the undertaking is submitted by 31.12.2022; until signed the employee does not join"

-- akn:art_f__para_3-3__subpara_3-3-1/p2 akn:art_f__para_3-3__subpara_3-3-1/p3 The portal link; no rule.

-- 3.3.3: the owner monitors compliance with the undertakings.
@ref akn:art_f__para_3-3__subpara_3-3-3/p1
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `circular 1 action`
DECIDE `monitoring the undertakings` IS
    PARTY `the employer` MUST `monitor the undertakings to complete an academic degree`

-- 3.3.4: proof of the degree within four years of JOINING: differences to
-- an academic's salary back to joining; later: the academic table, no
-- differences. F-2022-23_tashpag_01-e: 3.3.1 counts from SIGNING, and
-- annex ג dates the differences from signing.
@ref akn:art_f__para_3-3__subpara_3-3-4/p1
GIVEN `years from joining to the degree` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `differences retroactive to joining` `years from joining to the degree` IF
    `years from joining to the degree` AT MOST 4

DECLARE `start of the period` IS ONE OF
    `the date of signing the undertaking`
    `the date of joining the reform`

`the four years start, under 3.3.1`         MEANS `the date of signing the undertaking`
`the four years start, under 3.3.4`         MEANS `the date of joining the reform`
`the differences run back to, under 3.3.4`  MEANS `the date of joining the reform`
`the differences run back to, under annex ג` MEANS `the date of signing the undertaking`

GIVEN `start` IS A `start of the period`, `signed on` IS A NUMBER, `degree on` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the degree is in time from` `start` `signed on` `degree on` IF
    CONSIDER `start`
    WHEN `the date of signing the undertaking` THEN `degree on` MINUS `signed on` AT MOST 4 TIMES 365
    WHEN `the date of joining the reform`      THEN `degree on` AT MOST 4 TIMES 365

-- Joined on day 0, signed four months later (day 120), degree on day 1,520.
`the four-year periods start on different dates` MEANS
        NOT (`the degree is in time from` `the four years start, under 3.3.1` 120 1520
             EQUALS `the degree is in time from` `the four years start, under 3.3.4` 120 1520)
    AND NOT (`the differences run back to, under 3.3.4` EQUALS `the differences run back to, under annex ג`)
#ASSERT `the four-year periods start on different dates`

-- 3.4: a new academic in a kindergarten that joined joins if certified
-- and at a third of a position or more.
@ref akn:art_f__para_3-4/p1 akn:art_f__para_3-4/p2 akn:art_f__para_3-4/p3 akn:art_f__para_3-4/p4
GIVEN e IS A `kindergarten employee`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a new academic joins` e IF
        NOT `is an existing employee` e
    AND e's `academic`
    AND e's `teaching certificate`
    AND e's `employee's position fraction` AT LEAST (1 DIVIDED BY 3)

GIVEN e IS A `kindergarten employee`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `joins Ofek Hadash` e IF
    `an existing academic joins` e OR `an existing non-academic joins` e OR `a new academic joins` e

-- akn:art_f__para_3-5/p1 The heading of 3.5 (interns).

-- 3.5.1-3.5.3: interns only on reform terms; the year counts only at a
-- third of a position or more for at least six months of the school year
-- (July and August not counted); at most two school years, in which degree
-- and certificate are completed or reform employment ends; it counts for
-- tenure, jubilee grant and recuperation, not pay seniority or promotion periods.
@ref akn:art_f__para_3-5__subpara_3-5-1/p1 akn:art_f__para_3-5__subpara_3-5-2/p1
GIVEN `intern's position fraction` IS A NUMBER, `months so employed, July and August excluded` IS A NUMBER, `internship years` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the internship year is recognized` `intern's position fraction` `months so employed, July and August excluded` `internship years` IF
        `intern's position fraction` AT LEAST (1 DIVIDED BY 3)
    AND `months so employed, July and August excluded` AT LEAST 6
    AND `internship years` AT MOST 2

DECLARE `seniority purpose` IS ONE OF
    `pay seniority`
    `the minimal period for promotion`
    `tenure`
    `jubilee grant`
    `recuperation`

@ref akn:art_f__para_3-5__subpara_3-5-3/p1
GIVEN p IS A `seniority purpose`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the internship counts for` p IF
    CONSIDER p
    WHEN `pay seniority` THEN FALSE
    WHEN `the minimal period for promotion` THEN FALSE
    OTHERWISE TRUE

-- akn:art_f__para_3-6/p1 The heading of 3.6.

-- 3.6.1-3.6.5: all who meet the conditions must join; by exception a
-- request not to join for health (own or first-degree family, with current
-- certificates) or personal reasons (a change for the worse after joining),
-- on annex ה's form, through the owner and the portal, by 31.12.2022.
@ref akn:art_f__para_3-6__subpara_3-6-1/p1 akn:art_f__para_3-6__subpara_3-6-2/p1 akn:art_f__para_3-6__subpara_3-6-2/p2 akn:art_f__para_3-6__subpara_3-6-2/p3 akn:art_f__para_3-6__subpara_3-6-3/p1 akn:art_f__para_3-6__subpara_3-6-4/p1 akn:art_f__para_3-6__subpara_3-6-5/p1
GIVEN `meets the conditions` IS A BOOLEAN, `health reason` IS A BOOLEAN, `personal reason` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may ask not to join` `meets the conditions` `health reason` `personal reason` IF
    `meets the conditions` AND (`health reason` OR `personal reason`)

GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `circular 1 action`
DECIDE `requests not to join by 31.12.2022` IS
    PARTY `the teaching employee`
    MAY   `submit a request not to join`
    WITHIN `31 December 2022`

-- akn:art_f__para_3-6__subpara_3-6-4/p2 The portal link; no rule.

-- 3.7: a substitute on weekly hours (not single or occasional hours) is
-- employed on the terms of the kindergarten teacher replaced.
@ref akn:art_f__para_3-7/p1 akn:art_f__para_3-7/p2
GIVEN `on weekly hours` IS A BOOLEAN, `replaced teacher in Ofek Hadash` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the substitute is on Ofek Hadash terms` `on weekly hours` `replaced teacher in Ofek Hadash` IF
    `on weekly hours` AND `replaced teacher in Ofek Hadash`

§§ `4 מבנה שבוע העבודה בגני הילדים לחינוך מיוחד באופק חדש`

-- akn:art_f__para_3-7__subpara_4/p1 The heading of section 4 (the corpus nests it under 3.7).
-- akn:art_f__para_4-1/p1 The heading of 4.1.

DECLARE `kindergarten post` IS ONE OF
    `kindergarten head`
    `complementary kindergarten teacher`
    `kindergarten cluster manager`

DECLARE `base row` HAS
    `row group`        IS A STRING
    `head base`        IS A NUMBER
    `complementary base` IS A NUMBER
    `cluster manager base` IS A NUMBER

-- 4.1.1: the position base by age group, as printed (head, complementary,
-- cluster manager); "50-55 (לא כולל)"; at 55 and over the new and existing
-- teacher (3.1) differ. The footnote sends age hours to "section 7"
-- (F-2022-23_tashpag_01-c: they are section 8).
@ref akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-1/p1 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-1/p2 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-1/t1 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-1/p3 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-1/p4 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-1/p5 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-1/p6 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-1/p7
`the position bases` MEANS
    LIST `base row` "below 50"              30.4 33.8 34,
         `base row` "50-55, not including 55" 28.4 31.8 32,
         `base row` "55 and over, new"      28.4 31.8 32,
         `base row` "55 and over, existing" 26.4 29.8 30

GIVEN age IS A NUMBER, existing IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A STRING
DECIDE `the base row for` age existing IS
    IF age LESS THAN 50 THEN "below 50"
    ELSE IF age LESS THAN 55 THEN "50-55, not including 55"
         ELSE IF existing THEN "55 and over, existing"
              ELSE "55 and over, new"

GIVEN p IS A `kindergarten post`, age IS A NUMBER, existing IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the position base` p age existing IS
    sum (map (GIVEN r YIELD CONSIDER p
                            WHEN `kindergarten head` THEN r's `head base`
                            WHEN `complementary kindergarten teacher` THEN r's `complementary base`
                            WHEN `kindergarten cluster manager` THEN r's `cluster manager base`)
             (filter (GIVEN r YIELD r's `row group` EQUALS `the base row for` age existing) `the position bases`))

`the section the footnote names for age hours` MEANS 7
`the footnote names a section that is not the age hours'` MEANS
    NOT (`the topic of section` `the section the footnote names for age hours` EQUALS LIST "age hours")
#ASSERT `the footnote names a section that is not the age hours'`

-- 4.1.2: a head's and a complementary teacher's position is frontal hours
-- only; a cluster manager's 34 hours split by the number of kindergartens.
@ref akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-2/p1 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-2/p2 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-2/p3 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-2/p4 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-2/p5 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-2/p6 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-2/p7 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-2/t1
DECLARE `cluster row` HAS
    `kindergartens from` IS A NUMBER
    `kindergartens to`   IS A NUMBER
    `frontal or enrichment hours` IS A NUMBER
    `management hours`   IS A NUMBER
    `cluster total`      IS A NUMBER

`the cluster manager's hours` MEANS
    LIST `cluster row` 4  4  22 12 34,
         `cluster row` 5  5  19 15 34,
         `cluster row` 6  6  16 18 34,
         `cluster row` 7  7  13 21 34,
         `cluster row` 8  8  10 24 34,
         `cluster row` 9  9  7  27 34,
         `cluster row` 10 11 4  30 34

#ASSERT all (GIVEN r YIELD r's `frontal or enrichment hours` PLUS r's `management hours` EQUALS r's `cluster total`) `the cluster manager's hours`

-- 4.1.3-4.1.4: work starts at 7:55; the day ends (Sunday-Thursday /
-- Friday) by the kindergarten's disability type; where pre-reform days
-- ended at 16:00 or 16:45 the day is not lengthened and the teacher adds
-- forty minutes in overlap; a day ending at 14:00 is 6.08 hours of work.
@ref akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-3/p1 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-4/p1 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-4/p2 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-4/p3 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-4/p4 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-4/p5 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-4/p6 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-4/p7 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-4/p8 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-4/p9 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-4/p10 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-4/p11 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-4/p12 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-4/p13 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-4/p14 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-4/p15 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-4/p16
DECLARE `disability type` IS ONE OF
    `physical`, `deaf and hard of hearing`, `blind and visually impaired`,
    `moderate intellectual`, `moderate complex intellectual`, `severe or profound or nursing intellectual`,
    `autism`, `severe psychiatric disorders`, `mild intellectual`, `any other class`

GIVEN d IS A `disability type`
GIVETH A STRING
DECIDE `the Sunday-Thursday end time` d IS
    CONSIDER d
    WHEN `autism` THEN "16:45"
    WHEN `severe psychiatric disorders` THEN "16:00"
    WHEN `any other class` THEN "14:00"
    OTHERWISE "15:10"

`the Friday end time` MEANS "12:45"
`the work start time` MEANS "7:55"
`hours of a day ending at 14:00` MEANS 6.08

-- 4.1.5: the position = the weekly hours employed over the teacher's base.
@ref akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-5/p1 akn:art_f__para_4-1__subpara_4-1-5/p2
GIVEN `weekly hours` IS A NUMBER, `position base` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the position fraction` `weekly hours` `position base` IS
    `weekly hours` DIVIDED BY `position base`

-- 4.2: health professionals and arts therapists — 36 hours: 26 frontal,
-- 3 individual (content with the head of the setting), 7 stay hours on the
-- listed tasks.
@ref akn:art_f__para_4-2/p1 akn:art_f__para_4-2__subpara_a/p1 akn:art_f__para_4-2__subpara_b/p1 akn:art_f__para_4-2__subpara_c/p1 akn:art_f__para_4-2__subpara_c/p2 akn:art_f__para_4-2__subpara_c/p3 akn:art_f__para_4-2__subpara_c/p4 akn:art_f__para_4-2__subpara_c/p5 akn:art_f__para_4-2__subpara_c/p6 akn:art_f__para_4-2__subpara_c/p7 akn:art_f__para_4-2__subpara_c/p8 akn:art_f__para_4-2__subpara_c/p9
`a health professional's week hours`       MEANS 36
`a health professional's frontal hours`    MEANS 26
`a health professional's individual hours` MEANS 3
`a health professional's stay hours`       MEANS 7
#ASSERT `a health professional's frontal hours` PLUS `a health professional's individual hours` PLUS `a health professional's stay hours` EQUALS `a health professional's week hours`

-- akn:art_f__para_4-2__subpara_c/p10 akn:art_f__para_4-2__subpara_c/p11 akn:art_f__para_4-2__subpara_c/p12 A link to the detailed work-week table; no rule.

§§ `5 העסקה בחלקיות משרה ברפורמה`

-- akn:art_f__para_4-2__subpara_c__cls_5/p1 The heading of section 5 (the corpus nests it under 4.2(ג)).

-- 5.1-5.4: an existing kindergarten teacher at least a third; a new one
-- not below a third unless the personnel division's head approved; a
-- complementary teacher joins the reform terms only once her total in
-- reform kindergartens is a third or more (and in the others stays
-- pre-reform); a health professional may be below a third.
@ref akn:art_f__para_5-1/p1 akn:art_f__para_5-2/p1 akn:art_f__para_5-3/p1 akn:art_f__para_5-4/p1
GIVEN f IS A NUMBER, `health professional` IS A BOOLEAN, `new` IS A BOOLEAN, `division head approved` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may be employed at that fraction in the reform` f `health professional` `new` `division head approved` IF
    f AT LEAST (1 DIVIDED BY 3) OR `health professional` OR (`new` AND `division head approved`)

-- 5.5: a health professional's hours are pro-rated; below a third,
-- frontal hours only, the fraction being them over the base. 5.6: work
-- below a third does not count for the promotion period.
@ref akn:art_f__para_5-5/p1 akn:art_f__para_5-5/p2 akn:art_f__para_5-5/p3 akn:art_f__para_5-6/p1
GIVEN f IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the period counts for promotion` f IF
    f AT LEAST (1 DIVIDED BY 3)

§§ `6 העסקה מעל 100% משרה ברפורמה`

-- 6: where more than a full position is needed, the total is at most 42
-- weekly hours, in every kind of employment and hours — never more.
@ref akn:art_f__para_5-6__subpara_6/p1 akn:art_f__para_5-6__subpara_6/p2 akn:art_f__para_5-6__subpara_6/p3
GIVEN `weekly hours` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the weekly hours may be approved` `weekly hours` IF
    `weekly hours` AT MOST 42

-- akn:art_f__para_5-6__subpara_6/p4 A link to the guidance; no rule.

§§ `7 עובד הוראה אם`

-- akn:art_f__para_5-6__subpara_7/p1 The heading of section 7.

-- 7.1: a mother of a child up to 14, employed at 79% or more in all her
-- employment. 7.2: a mother kindergarten teacher may be absent a whole day
-- every two weeks or half a day a week, position and pay unchanged; if,
-- with her consent, she is not absent all year, her position rises by 10%,
-- above 100% if so. 7.3: a health professional or arts therapist: the
-- regular reform work week for a mother (linked table). 7.4: after
-- maternity leave at 90% or more, for four months a nursing hour a day
-- from the stay hours (five a week), and not 7.2-7.3 meanwhile; never both.
@ref akn:art_f__para_7-1/p1 akn:art_f__para_7-2/p1 akn:art_f__para_7-2__subpara_a/p1 akn:art_f__para_7-2__subpara_b/p1 akn:art_f__para_7-2__subpara_b/p2 akn:art_f__para_7-3/p1 akn:art_f__para_7-3/p2 akn:art_f__para_7-4/p1 akn:art_f__para_7-4/p2
GIVEN `youngest child's age` IS A NUMBER, f IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `entitled to a mother's position` `youngest child's age` f IF
    `youngest child's age` AT MOST 14 AND f AT LEAST 0.79

GIVEN f IS A NUMBER, `took no absence all year` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `a mother kindergarten teacher's position` f `took no absence all year` IS
    IF `took no absence all year` THEN f PLUS 0.10 ELSE f

-- akn:art_f__para_7-3/p3 akn:art_f__para_7-3/p4 A link to the work-week tables; no rule.

§§ `8 זכאות לשעות גיל`

-- akn:art_f__para_7-4__subpara_8/p1 The heading of section 8 (the corpus nests it under 7.4).

-- 8.1: by the age on 31 December of the school year, for the whole year.
-- 8.2: pro-rated for part time. 8.3: an existing teacher aged 50-55: 2
-- frontal hours less. 8.4: an existing teacher of 55 and over: 4. 8.5: a
-- new teacher of 50 and over: 2, no more at 55. F-2022-23_tashpag_01-f:
-- 8.3 and 8.4 both take an existing teacher of 55; 4.1.1's "(לא כולל)" is
-- the reading adopted.
@ref akn:art_f__para_8-1/p1 akn:art_f__para_8-2/p1 akn:art_f__para_8-3/p1 akn:art_f__para_8-4/p1 akn:art_f__para_8-5/p1
GIVEN age IS A NUMBER, existing IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the age-hours reduction` age existing IS
    IF age AT LEAST 55 AND existing THEN 4
    ELSE IF age AT LEAST 50 THEN 2
         ELSE 0

GIVEN age IS A NUMBER, existing IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A LIST OF NUMBER
DECIDE `the reductions the clauses give` age existing IS
    concat (LIST (IF existing AND age AT LEAST 50 AND age AT MOST 55 THEN LIST 2 ELSE EMPTY),
                 (IF existing AND age AT LEAST 55 THEN LIST 4 ELSE EMPTY),
                 (IF (NOT existing) AND age AT LEAST 50 THEN LIST 2 ELSE EMPTY))

`an existing teacher of 55 has two reductions` MEANS
    `the reductions the clauses give` 55 TRUE EQUALS LIST 2, 4
#ASSERT `an existing teacher of 55 has two reductions`

-- The table of 4.1.1 is the reductions applied to each base.
#ASSERT `the position base` `kindergarten head` 56 TRUE EQUALS 30.4 MINUS `the age-hours reduction` 56 TRUE
#ASSERT `the position base` `complementary kindergarten teacher` 52 TRUE EQUALS 33.8 MINUS `the age-hours reduction` 52 TRUE
#ASSERT `the position base` `kindergarten cluster manager` 60 FALSE EQUALS 34 MINUS `the age-hours reduction` 60 FALSE

-- 8.6: health professionals and arts therapists by the linked tables.
@ref akn:art_f__para_8-6/p1
`the age rules of health professionals are in the linked tables` MEANS TRUE

-- akn:art_f__para_8-6/p2 akn:art_f__para_8-6/p3 The link; no rule.

§§ `9 שעות פעילות גן`

-- akn:art_f__para_8-6__subpara_9/p1 The heading of section 9 (the corpus nests it under 8.6).

-- 9.1-9.4: an employee on reform terms (any fraction) is paid for
-- kindergarten activities beyond the position; allocated by need, at most
-- 18 hours in each half of the school year; for staff meetings, parent-and-
-- child meetings and after-hours events (health professionals: general
-- meetings, parent-and-child meetings and after-hours events).
@ref akn:art_f__para_8-6__subpara_9/p2 akn:art_f__para_8-6__subpara_9/p3 akn:art_f__para_8-6__subpara_9/p4 akn:art_f__para_8-6__subpara_9/p5 akn:art_f__para_8-6__subpara_9/p6 akn:art_f__para_8-6__subpara_9/p7 akn:art_f__para_8-6__subpara_9/p8 akn:art_f__para_8-6__subpara_9/p9 akn:art_f__para_9-4/p1 akn:art_f__para_9-4/p2 akn:art_f__para_9-4/p3 akn:art_f__para_9-4/p4
GIVEN `hours allocated in the half-year` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the activity hours are within the cap` `hours allocated in the half-year` IF
    `hours allocated in the half-year` AT MOST 18

§§ `10 קידום בדרגות הערכה ופיתוח מקצועי`

-- akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_10/p1 The heading of section 10 (the corpus nests it under 9.4).

-- 10.1: promotion needs the required period, development hours and an
-- evaluation by the Ministry's guidance.
@ref akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_10/p2 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_10/p3 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_10/p4 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_10/p8
DECLARE `promotion step` HAS
    `step`              IS A STRING
    `months required`   IS A NUMBER
    `development hours` IS A NUMBER
    `raise`             IS A NUMBER

GIVEN s IS A `promotion step`, months IS A NUMBER, hours IS A NUMBER, `evaluated` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may be promoted` s months hours `evaluated` IF
    months AT LEAST s's `months required` AND hours AT LEAST s's `development hours` AND `evaluated`

-- akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_10/p5 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_10/p6 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_10/p7 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_10/p9 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_10/p10 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_10/p11 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_10/p12 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_10/p13 Links on development hours, evaluation and the index map; no rule.

-- 10.2.1: certified academics. (The corpus prints 10.2.2's heading as the
-- table's last row.)
@ref akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_10/p14 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_10/p15 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_10/p16 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_10/t1
`the steps for certified academic teachers` MEANS
    LIST `promotion step` "1-2" 30 120 0.075, `promotion step` "2-3" 30 120 0.075,
         `promotion step` "3-4" 36 180 0.075, `promotion step` "4-5" 36 180 0.075,
         `promotion step` "5-6" 36 180 0.075, `promotion step` "6-7" 48 210 0.075,
         `promotion step` "7-8" 48 210 0.075, `promotion step` "8-9" 48 210 0.075

-- 10.2.2: uncertified academics. Existing ones "up to 25" years who joined
-- by exception are not promoted until certified, then the period runs from
-- joining for one promotion and up to 60 study hours count; "25 and above"
-- need not certify; new ones accrue from certification only.
-- F-2022-23_tashpag_01-d: 25 is in both groups; 3.2.1's "below 25" is read.
@ref akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_10/p17 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_10/p18 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_10/p19 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_10/p20 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_10/p21 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_10/p22
GIVEN e IS A `kindergarten employee`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an uncertified academic may be promoted` e IF
    e's `teaching certificate` OR (`is an existing employee` e AND e's `recognized teaching seniority` AT LEAST 25)

`study hours that count as development hours, at most` MEANS 60

GIVEN n IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A LIST OF BOOLEAN
DECIDE `what 10.2.2's two groups say of seniority` n IS
    append (IF n AT MOST 25 THEN LIST FALSE ELSE EMPTY) (IF n AT LEAST 25 THEN LIST TRUE ELSE EMPTY)

`10.2.2 gives 25 years both answers` MEANS
    `what 10.2.2's two groups say of seniority` 25 EQUALS LIST FALSE, TRUE
#ASSERT `10.2.2 gives 25 years both answers`

-- 10.2.3: certified non-academics: up to 27 years sign (3.3) and are not
-- promoted until the degree; 28 and above by the table.
@ref akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_10/p23 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_10/p24 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_10/p25 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_10/t2
`the steps for certified non-academic teachers of 28 years` MEANS
    LIST `promotion step` "1-2" 48 480 0.075, `promotion step` "2-3" 48 480 0.075,
         `promotion step` "3-4" 48 480 0.075, `promotion step` "4-5" 48 480 0.075,
         `promotion step` "5-6" 48 480 0.075, `promotion step` "6-7" 48 480 0.075,
         `promotion step` "7-8" 48 480 0.075, `promotion step` "8-9" 48 480 0.075

GIVEN e IS A `kindergarten employee`, `degree proven` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a non-academic may be promoted` e `degree proven` IF
    e's `recognized teaching seniority` AT LEAST 28 OR `degree proven`

§§ `11 גמולים המשולמים לגננות על פי תפקידן`

-- akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_11/p1 The heading of section 11 (the corpus nests it under 9.4).

-- 11 (head of kindergarten), 1: the management allowance — a new
-- teacher by grade (1-2: 17%, 3-4: 20%, 5-9: 21%), an existing one by
-- management seniority (up to 5 inclusive: 17%, 6-10 inclusive: 20%, above
-- 10: 21%). 2: one entitled on appointment to a trailing management or
-- counseling allowance gets the higher of the two.
@ref akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_11/p2 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_11/p3 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_11__cls_1/p1 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_11__cls_1/p2 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_11__cls_1/p3 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_11__cls_1/p4 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_11__cls_1/p5 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_11__cls_1/p6 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_11__cls_1/p7 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_11__cls_2/p1
GIVEN existing IS A BOOLEAN, grade IS A NUMBER, `management seniority` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the kindergarten management rate` existing grade `management seniority` IS
    IF existing
    THEN (IF `management seniority` AT MOST 5 THEN 0.17
          ELSE IF `management seniority` AT MOST 10 THEN 0.20
               ELSE 0.21)
    ELSE (IF grade AT MOST 2 THEN 0.17
          ELSE IF grade AT MOST 4 THEN 0.20
               ELSE 0.21)

GIVEN `management allowance` IS A NUMBER, `trailing allowance` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the head's management allowance` `management allowance` `trailing allowance` IS
    max `management allowance` `trailing allowance`

DECLARE `kindergarten role` IS ONE OF
    `complementary teacher in special education`
    `cluster manager of up to six kindergartens`
    `cluster manager of seven or more`
    `cluster centre teacher without a trailing allowance`
    `cluster centre teacher with a trailing allowance`

-- 11: a complementary teacher has no role allowance; a cluster manager
-- 25% (up to six kindergartens) or 28% (seven or more); a centre teacher
-- in a cluster 10% education allowance, if not entitled to a trailing
-- management allowance; a mentor 2.4% per intern, up to three; the
-- special-education supplement 14% of the combined salary with a special-
-- education certification, 8.5% without.
@ref akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_11__cls_2/p2 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_11__cls_2/p3 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_11__cls_2/p4 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_11__cls_2/p5 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_11__cls_2/p6 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_11__cls_2/p7 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_11__cls_2/p8 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_11__cls_2/p9 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_11__cls_2/p10 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_11__cls_2/p11
GIVEN r IS A `kindergarten role`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the role allowance rate` r IS
    CONSIDER r
    WHEN `complementary teacher in special education` THEN 0
    WHEN `cluster manager of up to six kindergartens` THEN 0.25
    WHEN `cluster manager of seven or more` THEN 0.28
    WHEN `cluster centre teacher without a trailing allowance` THEN 0.10
    WHEN `cluster centre teacher with a trailing allowance` THEN 0

@ref akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_11__cls_2/p12 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_11__cls_2/p13
GIVEN `interns mentored` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the mentor's allowance rate` `interns mentored` IS
    0.024 TIMES min `interns mentored` 3

@ref akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_11__cls_2/p14 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_11__cls_2/p15 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_11__cls_2/p16
GIVEN `special-education certification` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the special-education supplement rate` `special-education certification` IS
    IF `special-education certification` THEN 0.14 ELSE 0.085

§§ `12 קביעת הדרגה באופק חדש`

-- akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_12/p1 The heading of section 12 (the corpus nests it under 9.4).

-- 12: no grade without an opened file, a reported position and joining;
-- the Ministry alone sets it (12.1), from employment, education, seniority
-- and salary in the conversion month (12.2); for an existing employee by a
-- conversion of March of the year before joining (12.3) — the components
-- that do not continue in Ofek Hadash, at 100% by her roles (12.4); a half
-- grade is possible (12.5); more in annex ז (12.6).
@ref akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_12/p2 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_12/p3 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_12/p4 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_12/p5 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_12/p6 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_12/p7 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_12/p8 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_12/p9 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_12/p10
GIVEN `file opened` IS A BOOLEAN, `position reported` IS A BOOLEAN, `joined` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a grade can be set` `file opened` `position reported` `joined` IF
    `file opened` AND `position reported` AND `joined`

`the grade may be a half grade` MEANS TRUE

-- akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_12/p11 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_12/p12 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_12/p13 akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_12/p14 Links to the Ofek Hadash tables and the 2016 shekel-supplement circular; no rule.

§§ `13 מקדמות שכר עד לקביעת הדרגה`

-- akn:art_f__para_9-4__subpara_13/p1 The heading of section 13 (the corpus nests it under 9.4).

-- 13.1-13.2: until the grade is set, an advance on top of the current
-- (non-Ofek) salary, computed on its components (combined salary, the '87
-- and '94 supplements, supplements 2001, 2008 and 2011, the profession and
-- training, development and double-degree allowances), only for the
-- fraction in the joined kindergarten and from joining; the owner computes
-- and pays it as "מקדמת אופק חדש"; once the grade is set, pay is recomputed
-- back to joining and what was paid, advance included, is offset.
@ref akn:art_f__para_13-1/p1 akn:art_f__para_13-2/p1 akn:art_f__para_13-2/p2
GIVEN `rate` IS A NUMBER, `current components` IS A NUMBER @desc the month's current salary in the listed components, for the fraction in the joined kindergarten
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the Ofek Hadash advance` `rate` `current components` IS
    `rate` TIMES `current components`

DECLARE `advance group` IS ONE OF
    `academic kindergarten teacher`
    `academic health professional`
    `intern`
    `non-academic of 28 years or who signed the undertaking`

-- 13.3: the rates.
@ref akn:art_f__para_13-3/p1 akn:art_f__para_13-3/p2 akn:art_f__para_13-3/p3 akn:art_f__para_13-3/p4 akn:art_f__para_13-3/p5 akn:art_f__para_13-3/p6 akn:art_f__para_13-3/p7
GIVEN g IS AN `advance group`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the advance rate of` g IS
    CONSIDER g
    WHEN `academic kindergarten teacher` THEN 0.16
    WHEN `academic health professional` THEN 0.17
    WHEN `intern` THEN 0.14
    WHEN `non-academic of 28 years or who signed the undertaking` THEN 0.10

-- 14 (nested by the corpus under 13.3): the circular collects the
-- agreements' rules; where they conflict, the agreements govern, for or
-- against the employee.
@ref akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14/p1
GIVEN `the circular and an agreement conflict` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A STRING
DECIDE `which governs` `the circular and an agreement conflict` IS
    IF `the circular and an agreement conflict` THEN "the collective agreements" ELSE "this circular"

-- akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14/p2 akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14/p3 akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14/p4 akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14/p5 akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14/p6 akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14/p7 akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14/p8 akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14/p9 akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14/p10 akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14/p11 akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14/p12 akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14/p13 akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14/p14 akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14/p15 akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14/p16 akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14/p17 akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14/p18 akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14/p19 akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14/p20 akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14/p21 akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14/p22 akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14/p23 akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14/p24 akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14/p25 akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14/p26 akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14/p27 The sign-off, signatories and list of copies (the corpus nests them under 13.3); no rule.

§§ `The owner's undertaking (the form after the sign-off)`

-- The undertaking's heading and its deadline (15.8.2022, the duty above);
-- the signatory's identification of the owner.
-- akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14/p28 akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14/p29 akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14/p30 The undertaking form's title (deadline 15.8.2022, encoded at 2.1.1(1)), the signatory's identification of the owner and the words "I undertake to do all that follows".

-- The undertaking's terms: (1) apply from 2022-23 every Ofek Hadash
-- provision for kindergartens (agreement of 25.12.2008 as updated): work
-- week, day length, pay, pedagogical guidance; (2) pass the Ministry all
-- data it requires; (3) pay the advance as the Ministry directs, (א)
-- labelled "מקדמת אופק חדש" on the payslip, (ב) with annex A's letter to
-- each employee, (ג) and each employee's signature on annex B; (4) keep
-- those undertakings and pass them on request; (5) have every employee
-- lacking the education condition who asks to be on Ofek Hadash terms sign
-- an undertaking to complete it (annexes ג, ד); (6) pass the payslips on
-- request; (7) an employee may ask the exceptions committee not to join
-- (annex ה). Breach may bring sanctions — offset of the budget given for
-- Ofek Hadash, up to revoking the licence.
@ref akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14__cls_1/p1 akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14__cls_2/p1 akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14__cls_3/p1 akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14__cls_3__pnt_a/p1 akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14__cls_3__pnt_b/p1 akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14__cls_3__pnt_c/p1 akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14__cls_4/p1 akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14__cls_5/p1 akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14__cls_6/p1 akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14__cls_7/p1 akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14__cls_7/p2
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `circular 1 action`
DECIDE `the undertaking's terms` IS
         (PARTY `the employer` MUST `pass the Ministry the data and payslips it requires`)
    RAND (PARTY `the employer` MUST `label the advance on the payslip`)
    RAND (PARTY `the employer` MUST `send each employee annex A's letter`)
    RAND (PARTY `the employer` MUST `have each employee sign annex B's undertaking`)
    RAND (PARTY `the employer` MUST `keep the employees' undertakings and pass them on request`)

DECLARE `sanction` IS ONE OF
    `offset of the Ofek Hadash budget`
    `revocation of the licence`

`the sanctions the undertaking names, at most` MEANS LIST `offset of the Ofek Hadash budget`, `revocation of the licence`

-- akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14__cls_7/p3 akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14__cls_7/p4 akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14__cls_7/p5 akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14__cls_7/p6 akn:art_f__para_13-3__subpara_14__cls_7/p7 The signatory's confirmation and the signature lines; no rule.

§§ `Annexes`

-- akn:att_1__hc_1 Annex A, the owner's letter to each employee: the advance "רכיב בגין אופק חדש" is on account of the pay due once the Ministry sets the grade, and is then deducted in full with the pre-reform pay, subject to the Wage Protection Law 1958; the duty to send it is the undertaking's (3)(ב).
-- akn:att_2__hc_1 Annex B, the employee's undertaking that the advance will be deducted in full and that he will have no claim; the duty to have it signed is the undertaking's (3)(ג).
-- akn:att_3__hc_1 Annex ג, the non-academic's declaration and undertaking to complete a degree within four years of SIGNING, with differences "from signing" if completed within four years of JOINING (F-2022-23_tashpag_01-e), due 31.12.2022; the rule is 3.3.
-- akn:att_4__hc_1 Annex ד, the request for exceptional joining of an academic without a teaching certificate, due 31.12.2022; the rule is 3.2.1.
-- akn:att_5__hc_1 Annex ה, the request to the exceptions committee not to join, due 31.12.2022; the rule is 3.6.
-- akn:att_8__hc_1 Annex ח, the national service centre and the districts' reception hours and addresses; no rule.

-- Annex ו: the kindergarten teachers' work-week table — rows by post,
-- base, the position in percent and, where printed, the weekly hours
-- actually worked. Its notes apply 4.1.5 and 7.2: a whole day absent every
-- two weeks or half a day a week does not reduce a mother's position; a
-- mother not absent at all gains 10%; age hours reduce the base.
@ref akn:att_6__hc_1
DECLARE `annex row` HAS
    `serial`          IS A NUMBER
    `row base`        IS A NUMBER
    `row percent`     IS A NUMBER
    `row hours`       IS A NUMBER @desc the weekly hours actually worked, as printed; 0 where none is printed

`annex ו's rows` MEANS
    LIST `annex row` 1  30.4 100   30.4,
         `annex row` 2  30.4 100   27.4,
         `annex row` 3  30.4 110   30.4,
         `annex row` 4  33.8 90    30.8,
         `annex row` 5  33.8 90    27.8,
         `annex row` 6  33.8 100   30.8,
         `annex row` 7  28.4 107   0,
         `annex row` 8  26.4 103.6 0,
         `annex row` 9  28.4 100   0,
         `annex row` 10 31.8 90    0,
         `annex row` 11 29.8 90    0,
         `annex row` 12 31.8 95.5  0,
         `annex row` 13 30.4 100   0,
         `annex row` 14 34   100   0,
         `annex row` 15 34   110   34,
         `annex row` 16 32   100   0,
         `annex row` 17 30   100   0

GIVEN n IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A LIST OF `annex row`
DECIDE `annex row number` n IS filter (GIVEN r YIELD r's `serial` EQUALS n) `annex ו's rows`

-- Row 1: a head working five days of 6.08 hours: 30.4 hours, 100% of 30.4.
#ASSERT 5 TIMES `hours of a day ending at 14:00` EQUALS 30.4
#ASSERT all (GIVEN r YIELD r's `row hours` EQUALS 5 TIMES `hours of a day ending at 14:00` AND r's `row percent` EQUALS 100) (`annex row number` 1)
-- Rows 7 and 8, by their notes: five days on a base of 28.4 is 107%; on
-- 26.4, 115.15%; one day less every two weeks, 103.63%.
#ASSERT TRUNC (100 TIMES `the position fraction` 30.4 28.4) 0 EQUALS 107
#ASSERT TRUNC (10000 TIMES `the position fraction` 30.4 26.4) 0 EQUALS 11515
#ASSERT TRUNC (10000 TIMES `the position fraction` (30.4 MINUS 3.04) 26.4) 0 EQUALS 10363

-- F-2022-23_tashpag_01-g: row 4's note — "works five days a week, 6.08
-- each day … because she actually works 30.8 hours" — and its 30.8 hours:
-- five days of 6.08 are 30.4, and 30.8 over the base of 33.8 is 91.1%,
-- not the row's 90% (30.4 over 33.8 is 89.9%).
`row 4's hours are not five days of 6.08` MEANS
    all (GIVEN r YIELD NOT (r's `row hours` EQUALS 5 TIMES `hours of a day ending at 14:00`)
                   AND NOT (TRUNC (100 TIMES `the position fraction` (r's `row hours`) (r's `row base`) PLUS 0.5) 0 EQUALS r's `row percent`)
                   AND TRUNC (100 TIMES `the position fraction` (5 TIMES `hours of a day ending at 14:00`) (r's `row base`) PLUS 0.5) 0 EQUALS r's `row percent`)
        (`annex row number` 4)
#ASSERT `row 4's hours are not five days of 6.08`

-- Annex ז: grade and conversion. An existing employee's grade is set by
-- converting her salary (by her data, roles and stage before joining); a
-- new one is placed at grade 1 by education and role, no conversion; the
-- Ministry alone sets grades. A = X × (100 + Y)%: X the March salary at
-- 100% in the listed components (the joining month if none in March), Y
-- 16% for an academic kindergarten teacher, 14.4% (16% × 0.9) otherwise.
@ref akn:att_7__hc_1/p1 akn:att_7__hc_1/p2 akn:att_7__hc_1/p3 akn:att_7__hc_1/p4 akn:att_7__hc_1/p5 akn:att_7__hc_1__para_1/p1 akn:att_7__hc_1__para_1__subpara_a akn:att_7__hc_1__para_1__subpara_b/p1 akn:att_7__hc_1__para_1__subpara_b/p2 akn:att_7__hc_1__para_1__subpara_b/p3 akn:att_7__hc_1__para_1__subpara_b/p4 akn:att_7__hc_1__para_1__subpara_b/p5 akn:att_7__hc_1__para_1__subpara_b/p6 akn:att_7__hc_1__para_1__subpara_b/p7
GIVEN X IS A NUMBER @desc the salary for conversion, at a full position
      Y IS A NUMBER @desc the conversion coefficient, in percent
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the converted salary` X Y IS
    X TIMES (100 PLUS Y) DIVIDED BY 100

GIVEN academic IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `a kindergarten teacher's coefficient` academic IS
    IF academic THEN 16 ELSE 16 TIMES 0.9

#ASSERT `a kindergarten teacher's coefficient` FALSE EQUALS 14.4

-- akn:att_7__hc_1__para_1__subpara_b/p8 akn:att_7__hc_1__para_1__subpara_b/p9 akn:att_7__hc_1__para_1__subpara_b/p10 akn:att_7__hc_1__para_1__subpara_b/p11 A page letterhead inside the annex; no rule.

-- Annex ז's example: an academic kindergarten teacher, position factor
-- 0.9: components 6,105.38; X = 6,783.75; × 1.034 ("תוספת שחיקה") =
-- 7,014.39; A = 116% × 7,014.39 = 8,136.69; placed at seniority 10 at the
-- nearest salary at or above A, ₪8,368.38, grade 4.
@ref akn:att_7__hc_1__para_1__subpara_b/p12 akn:att_7__hc_1__para_1__subpara_b/p13 akn:att_7__hc_1__para_1__subpara_b/p14 akn:att_7__hc_1__para_1__subpara_b/p15 akn:att_7__hc_1__para_1__subpara_b/p16 akn:att_7__hc_1__para_1__subpara_b/p17 akn:att_7__hc_1__para_1__subpara_b/p18 akn:att_7__hc_1__para_1__subpara_b/p19 akn:att_7__hc_1__para_1__subpara_b/p20 akn:att_7__hc_1__para_1__subpara_b/p21 akn:att_7__hc_1__para_1__subpara_b/p22 akn:att_7__hc_1__para_1__subpara_b/p23 akn:att_7__hc_1__para_1__subpara_b/p24 akn:att_7__hc_1__para_1__subpara_b/p25 akn:att_7__hc_1__para_1__subpara_b/p26 akn:att_7__hc_1__para_1__subpara_b/p27 akn:att_7__hc_1__para_1__subpara_b/p28 akn:att_7__hc_1__para_1__subpara_c akn:att_7__hc_1__para_1__subpara_d/p1 akn:att_7__hc_1__para_1__subpara_d/p2 akn:att_7__hc_1__para_1__subpara_d/p3 akn:att_7__hc_1__para_1__subpara_d/p4
`the example's components` MEANS
    LIST 3779.38, 141.21, 113.38, 187.25, 259.08, 157.03, 268.82, 900.54, 298.69
`the example's stated full-position X`  MEANS 6783.75
`the erosion factor the example applies` MEANS 1.034
`the example's stated X after erosion`  MEANS 7014.39
`the example's stated A`                MEANS 8136.69

GIVEN x IS A NUMBER, y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE x `is within an agora of` y IF
    x MINUS y AT MOST 0.01 AND y MINUS x AT MOST 0.01

#ASSERT (sum `the example's components`) `is within an agora of` 6105.38
#ASSERT (6105.38 DIVIDED BY 0.9) `is within an agora of` `the example's stated full-position X`
#ASSERT (`the example's stated full-position X` TIMES `the erosion factor the example applies`) `is within an agora of` `the example's stated X after erosion`
#ASSERT (`the converted salary` `the example's stated X after erosion` (`a kindergarten teacher's coefficient` TRUE)) `is within an agora of` `the example's stated A`
#ASSERT 8368.38 AT LEAST `the example's stated A`

-- F-2022-23_tashpag_01-h: the formula on the example's own X does not
-- give its A; the example multiplies by 1.034, which neither the formula
-- nor the definition of X has.
`the formula as stated does not give the example's A` MEANS
    NOT ((`the converted salary` `the example's stated full-position X` (`a kindergarten teacher's coefficient` TRUE)) `is within an agora of` `the example's stated A`)
#ASSERT `the formula as stated does not give the example's A`

-- akn:att_7__hc_1__para_1__subpara_d/p5 The heading "דגשים".

-- Annex ז 1(ד): a new academic (after the internship) is placed at grade
-- 1, seniority 1, without conversion; one on unpaid leave, sabbatical or
-- other unpaid absence the year before joining is converted on September's
-- salary of the year of joining.
@ref akn:att_7__hc_1__para_1__subpara_d__cls_1/p1 akn:att_7__hc_1__para_1__subpara_d__cls_1__pnt_1/p1 akn:att_7__hc_1__para_1__subpara_d__cls_1__pnt_2/p1
GIVEN `absent without pay before joining` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A STRING
DECIDE `the conversion month` `absent without pay before joining` IS
    IF `absent without pay before joining` THEN "September of the year of joining" ELSE "March of the year before joining"

-- Examples. The employees are made up.
`an existing academic kindergarten teacher at 40%` MEANS
    `kindergarten employee` WITH
        `recognized teaching seniority`       IS 12
        `academic`                            IS TRUE
        `teaching certificate`                IS TRUE
        `employee's position fraction`        IS 0.4
        `signed the academic-completion undertaking` IS FALSE
        `approved by the exceptions committee` IS FALSE

`an existing non-academic of 29 years` MEANS
    `kindergarten employee` WITH
        `recognized teaching seniority`       IS 29
        `academic`                            IS FALSE
        `teaching certificate`                IS TRUE
        `employee's position fraction`        IS 1
        `signed the academic-completion undertaking` IS FALSE
        `approved by the exceptions committee` IS FALSE

#ASSERT `joins Ofek Hadash` `an existing academic kindergarten teacher at 40%`
#ASSERT `joins Ofek Hadash` `an existing non-academic of 29 years`
#ASSERT `the position base` `kindergarten head` 45 TRUE EQUALS 30.4
#ASSERT `the position base` `complementary kindergarten teacher` 57 TRUE EQUALS 29.8
#ASSERT `the position base` `kindergarten cluster manager` 57 FALSE EQUALS 32
#ASSERT `the kindergarten management rate` TRUE 0 7 EQUALS 0.20
#ASSERT `the kindergarten management rate` FALSE 5 0 EQUALS 0.21
#ASSERT `the advance rate of` `academic kindergarten teacher` EQUALS 0.16
